<div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="twoColumnArticleTheme"><div id="sectionHeadingForTwoColumnArticle"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Why SIPROTEC 7SJ86?</span></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="text-start container multitextblock two-column-article"><div class="m-t-xl two-column-article-content layout-7-to-3 two-layout-top-alignment"><div class="p-lg-r-lg"><div><p>The SIPROTEC 7SJ86 overcurrent protection device provides backup and emergency protection for line protection systems. It delivers solutions for protection, control, automation, monitoring and power quality.</p><p>Prevent extensive damage and maintain continuous operation with reliable backup protection. The SIPROTEC 7SJ86 offers overcurrent protection for all voltage levels with 3-pole tripping. Optimize tripping times using directional comparison and protection data communication, detecting various ground faults. Gain flexibility and comprehensive system management with the modular structure and DIGSI 5 engineering tool.</p></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='56mqMIp0B82CDici1en0bo' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_2' data-ste-section-id='56mqMIp0B82CDici1en0bo'>
