<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Provide reliable line protection" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Provide reliable line protection</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Offer backup and emergency protection for line devices. Detect and trip 3-pole short circuits across diverse networks and voltage levels. Identify ground faults in isolated or arc-suppression-coil systems for stable operations.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Enhance operational safety and availability" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Enhance operational safety and availability</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Enhance safety with powerful protection functions and a user-friendly design for easy device and software handling. Maintain high availability in extreme conditions with conformal coating on electronic boards for robust operation.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Strengthen system security and compliance" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Strengthen system security and compliance</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Implement robust cybersecurity measures per NERC CIP and BDEW Whitepaper requirements. Protect your critical infrastructure for a compliant environment.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='1WPAYeAbG07T91RZTBqDBy' class='si